            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2" xml:id="kock-0443-bakchai-2" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0443_bakchai">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="kock-0443-bakchai-2-l1" xml:lang="grc">πλυνεῖ τε τὰ κακὰ τῶν κακῶν ὑμᾶς.</l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">Photius et Suidas κακὰ κακῶν· Διοκλῆς Βάκχῃ κτλ. πλυνεῖ τε</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="3" xml:id="kock-0443-bakchai-3" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0443_bakchai">
              <head>ἀσκοθύλακος</head>
              <note type="source">Διοκλῆς Βάκχαις καὶ Ἄρχιππος Ἀμφιτρύωνι δευτέρῳ. Bekker. Anecd. 452, 28. cf. Aristoph. fr. 174. Archipp. 4.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="4" xml:id="kock-0443-bakchai-4" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0443_bakchai">
